      "id": "switch.top-saucer-kicker",
      "kind": "switch",
      "label": "Top Saucer Kicker",
      "physical": {
        "notes": "Legacy import set the legacy Bally platform map's 'Tilt' (alias s_tilt) against the game file's 'Top Saucer Kicker'. The known-working VPW table writes public 7 from the top kicker sw7, which its solenoid 1 and 2 callbacks kick out. In a spectru4 gameplay run closing public 7 fires the top kicker (1) and scores 10,000, and public 19 stays raised. The platform alias is dropped: the run's tilt bob is public 15, as the table's vpmNudge.TiltSwitch is."
      },
      "provenance": {
